<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">- Makua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Nayakhobo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Iwarakha ilhepiye ni Nayakhobo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nayakhobo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Nayak</para>
  <para style="mt2">Iwarakha ilhepiye ni</para>
  <para style="mt1">Nayakhobo</para>
  <para style="imt">Malhove o uholhelha</para>
  <para style="ip">Iwarakha ilhepiye ni Nayakhobo ilha yaalhepiye ni ntu mmoka ehaniya Yakhobo. Yoyo ntu uyo veekinaka aari phi Nayakhobo nhima awe Yesu, aari phi nholhelhi o nlhoko wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo o pacha ni mmoka o nlhoko wa ashulhupalhe o ipuwa yo Uyerusalemu (Mitk nlhako wo 15:13). Akarumiya Napaolo ni ayo tho ahomwiihana yoyo ntu uyo “nipoto” no nlhoko wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo mu iwarakha wa Agalatiya (Agal nlhako wo 2:9). Attu o ushoma anorumelhelhacha wiira iwarakha i Nayakhobo yaalhepiye iyaakha yo 50 baada yo uyaria wa Kuristo. Ni ukhalhawaya Nayakhobo phi aari nholhelhi o nlhoko wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo o Uyerusalemu, veekinaka aalhempe ikatema vaari aya akhalhaka wowo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nayakhobo ayo anolhepa iwarakha aya iyo urwaa wa attu o “makosho khumi ni melhi amwareelhe velhaponi va” (nlhako wo 1:1). Meettuchiho anopattiya nkitabuni mu Nayakhobo ahorera wiittuchiya ni attu o nlhoko unrumelhenlhe Kuristo onkhaye nansho nlhove ninoromolha, “makosho khumi ni melhi” ninooniha mwaari wiira Nayakhobo aalhempe aachaka Ayahudi anrumelhenlhe Kuristo. Ukhalhawaya ilha iwarakha ilha yaalhakelhiye wiira yashomiye ni nlhoko mulhupalhe wa attu, nhina mmo ihohimiacha chittu chinchi. Nayakhobo anowehaweha mwaha wo unlhoko unaacha upisha nrima ni mitheko. Upisha nrima wo ikekhiaye unoonihiya wo uvara mitheko (nlhako wo 2:17). Tho, anaamuka mwaha wo ulhohiya chinene attu o nhakhu (nlhako wo 2:1-4) ni unihimiachera wiira niweheke rata chittu chinoolhumacha ihu (nlhako wo 3:1-12).</para>
  <para style="iot">Chiri nhina</para>
  <para style="io">Nayakhobo anowaashikuria attu anoshoma iwarakha aya (nlhako wo 1:1).</para>
  <para style="io">Tho, anowaahelha nrima attu o nlhoko unrumelhenlhe Kuristo wiira avilhelheke vanohuva aya (nlhako wo 1:2-27).</para>
  <para style="io">Thothoni tho, anohimia wiira upisha nrima woonihiyeke wo mitheko (nlhako wo 2:1-26).</para>
  <para style="io">Baada yo vavawo, anohimia Malhove chiri aya ni machiri (nlhako wo 3:1-12).</para>
  <para style="io">Nayakhobo tho, anoohimia Irusho cha Nlhuku chihinolhikaana aya ni irusho cha attu (nlhako wo 3:13-4:10).</para>
  <para style="io">Anowaamuka attu anoshoma iwarakha aya, wiira ahikhalhe ni nrima wo wiifuna (nlhako wo 4:11-5:6).</para>
  <para style="io">Nayakhobo anomalhiha iwarakha aya wo uhimiacha ikano cho umalhihera (nlhako wo 5:7-20).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1" />Mii Yakhobo, karumiya a Nlhuku ni karumiya a Athithi Yesu Kuristo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 1:1">Kinoowiiha isalamu uwaninyu mwaatti makosho khumi ni meelhi amwarelhe velhaponi vonkhaye.<verse eid="JAS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upisha nrima ni Irusho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2" />Ashilhoko aka, nteelhiyeke vanolhikachiya inyu wo kila iphiro, <verse eid="JAS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3" />ukhalhawaya nhochuwelha wiira nrima inyu walhikachiyaka phi nooria inyu uvilhelha. <verse eid="JAS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4" />Nansho nkhalheke ni ikekhiaye wiira uvilhelha winyu unoworihani uhikhwa nrima, wiira ntimire ni ukhomalha mpaka umalhelha nhiwukuwelhiyaka ittu.<verse eid="JAS 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5" />Nansho mmoka inyu awukuwelhiyaka irusho anlhepelheke Nlhuku nommaha, ukhalhawaya Nlhuku phi naavaha attu onkhaye wo winchiva ni wo urera nrima. <verse eid="JAS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6" />Nansho alhapelheke wo nrima wo urumelhelha ni uhichukulha. Ukhalhawaya ntu o uchukulhacha ri thoko mawimbi o bahari anokakhiya ni uveverushiya ni iphioo uno ni uno. <verse eid="JAS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7" />Ntu thoko yoyo haanyihere wiira noopochera ittu iriyoothe wa Athithi. <verse eid="JAS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8" />Ukhalhawaya ntu o mirima miilhi, khanooria wiitawara mmakhalhelhoni mwawe mwonkhaye.<verse eid="JAS 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhakhu ni uhikhalha ni ittu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9" />Nlhoko ihu nonrumelhelha Kuristo hirina ittu ateelhiyeke Nlhuku vanommwelhiha awe, <verse eid="JAS 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10" />ni munnihu ntu o nhakhu nrumelhenlhe Kuristo ni uyo ateelhiyeke Nlhuku vanonkurusha awe. Ukhalhawaya attu o nhakhu anowa umora thoko ituva. <verse eid="JAS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11" />Ukhalhawaya nchuwa vanopharelha aya ni uviha ninoopaha minyepu, ituva chinoonyaalha ni umora ni urera waya wonkhaye unoomalha. Phi chiichammo etu, attu o upuha anoonyalha thoko ituva mu upuhani mwaya.<verse eid="JAS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uphimiya ni ulhikachiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12" />Horeeriya ntu o uvilhelha vanolhikachiya awe, ukhalhawaya avilhelhaka ulhikachiya, nowa uttukiya mphumburu wo ukumi Nlhuku alhehilhe awe attu anonttuna. <verse eid="JAS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13" />Ntu vanolhikachiyaka awe hiire, “Nlhuku phi nokilhikacha!” Ukhalhawaya Nlhuku khanolhikachiya wo uwonya mena khanonlhikacha ntu riyoothe wo uwonya. <verse eid="JAS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14" />Nansho kila ntu nolhikachiya ni uthepiachiya wo nrima awe wo uhilhoka vanopurulhiya awe ni uwaya mu uwonyani. <verse eid="JAS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15" />Nrima wo uhilhoka uyo wakhomaalhaka phi nowiiha milhatu cho uwonya ni uwonya uwo wakhomaalhaka, phi nommwiiha nookhwa.<verse eid="JAS 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16" />Ashilhoko aka nhithepiachiye! <verse eid="JAS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17" />Kila izawadi yoombone inokumihiya ni kila ittu izawadi inokumihiya inatiminre inokhuma uchulhu wa Nlhuku oopilhe nchuwa ni mweeri ni ittotwa chinomwalhia wiirimu. Nlhuku hinorukunuwa mena upitikuwacha thoko mittuuchi. <verse eid="JAS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18" />Wo uttuna wawe mwanene ahoniyara hii wo nlhove nawe ne ikeekhene nikhalhe o upacha munlhokoni mwo chittu chawe chonkhaye chuupiye.<verse eid="JAS 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wiiwa ni Upanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19" />Ashilhoko aka nchuwelheke yayo. Kila ntu aalhuweke wiiwa nansho apicheke wulhumacha ni tho apicheke uthunalha. <verse eid="JAS 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20" />Ukhalhawaya ntu o uthunalha khanooria ukhalha makhalhelho o upanga chittu chinothanana awe Nlhuku. <verse eid="JAS 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21" />Paahi etu nhiyeke iphiro cho uhilhokalhoka ni uwonya uriwoothe. Mpochereke wo wiitimarikha nlhove naalhiye munrimani mwinyu ninooria uwoopolhani.<verse eid="JAS 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22" />Paahi etu, mpangelheke mitheko malhove aneewa inyu ayo, nhikhalhe attu o wiiwelhelha nlhove vekha ayaru, ni wiithepia mwaashineneru. <verse eid="JAS 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23" />Ukhalhawaya ntu neewa nlhove vekha aya hoonihaka mitheko, yoyo nolhikaana ni ntu neeweha ikhove awe vakiooni. <verse eid="JAS 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24" />Ukhalhawaya vavawo nowiichoona, nansho athamaka noolhiyalha ikhove awe chiri aya. <verse eid="JAS 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25" />Nansho ntu nohelhelha malhehero atiminre anoopolha attu, ntu nothepa uvarechesha, hikhalhaka ntu o wiiwelhelha ni ulhiyalha, nansho nokhalha ntu o upangelha mitheko, yoyo Nlhuku nommaha ibarakha ni ummaha mpuha wo mitheko chonkhaye chinopanga awe.<verse eid="JAS 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26" />Ntu echoonaka wiira hochuwelha unthimicha Nlhuku, aahitawareke nlhimi nawe, nothepiacha nrima awe mwanene, uthimicha wawe uwo khunokhalha ittu. Ukhalhawaya khanonthimicha Nlhuku. <verse eid="JAS 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27" />Iphiro yo unthimicha Nlhuku Athumwanihu iri yorera ihiri ni milhatu cho unanara mmiholho wawe phi ilha, Waalhoha ashaana akhwelhiye ni manyanaangoro aya, ni waalhoha anankhwelhi mu uhuvani mwaya ni wiichinanelha mwanene wiira hinanarihiye ni chittu cho uhilhokalhoka cho velhaponi va.<verse eid="JAS 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2" />
  <para style="s1">Waamukiya mwaha wo unyaraphana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1" />Ashilhoko aka, mwaarumelhelhaka Athithi Yesu Kuristo, Athithi o nthimicho, nhaanyaraphe attu. <verse eid="JAS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2" />Ukhalhawaya awaaka ntu nawanre ikuwo chorera ni ipete yo idhahabu nnikokhoni mwawe u inupa inyu yo unlhapelha Nlhuku, ni vavawo nkaawa ntu hirina ittu mwommo nawanre matapwata, <verse eid="JAS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3" />mwanlhohaka ntu warenlhe ulhe ni umwiirelha, Kharibu nkhalheke va varenreva ni vavawo mmwiirelhaka ntu nshikini uyo, Mweemelheke uwo ama mwiiraka nkhalheke vathi vawo, <verse eid="JAS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4" />chani vavawo khannoona wiira nhonyarapha? Chani khannochuwelha vavawo wiira khannohukumulha wo uholhelhiya ni nrima wo uhilhoka?<verse eid="JAS 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5" />Ashilhoko aka, nkakiiweni! Chani Nlhuku kaathanlhe attu ahirina ittu o velhaponi va wiira akhalhe phi attu o nhakhu wo mupishani nrima anohalha upochera Imwene ilhehiye attu anonttuna. <verse eid="JAS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6" />Nansho mwaatti khannaalhoha attu ahirina ittu. Anaa attu o nhakhu kahiwe phi yayo anowoonelhani mwaatti ayo, kahii phi yayo anouhukumulhani ayo? <verse eid="JAS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7" />Ni ayo kahiwe phi ayo anoruwana nchina ninyu no nthimicho na Kuristo nneehanelhiya inyu nno?<verse eid="JAS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8" />Nansho mwavarecheshaka malhehero o Imwene ya Nlhuku ihimiye ni Malhove Matakatifu aneera, “Mwaattuneke amwatamana inyu thoko chineettuna inyu mwaanene.” Wo ikekhiaye, vavawo nnoopanga ittu yoombone. <verse eid="JAS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9" />Nansho mwaanyaraphaka nhowonya, Malhehero anouhukumulhani wiira nhotteka. <verse eid="JAS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10" />Ukhalhawaya ntu awonyaka ata nlhove nimoka nhina Malhehero a Nlhuku, howonya Ikekhia yonkhaye. <verse eid="JAS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11" />Ukhalhawaya yoyo eerilhe “Nhilhavelhave” uyo, phi yoyo enre, “Nhiive.” Paahi etu inakhalhaka khannolhavalhava nansho nheeva, nhowonya Malhehero onkhaye. <verse eid="JAS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12" />Paahi etu mulhumacheke ni waaweha attu thoko attu anohalha uhukumulhiya ni Malhehero anooria unihiyerera. <verse eid="JAS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13" />Nlhuku khanowa aamwonelha ikiriri ntu hirina ikiriri. Nansho attu o ikiriri khanoova uhukumulhiya ni Nlhuku, ukhalhawaya ikiriri ya Nlhuku inoopwaha ihukumu.<verse eid="JAS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Upisha nrima ni Mitheko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14" />Ashilhoko aka, inoreerani ntu vaneera awe noopisha nrima nansho hoonihaka wo mitheko choombone? Chani yoyo nrima uyo unowa umoopolha? <verse eid="JAS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15" />Ikhalhe wiira haawo munnihu mmoka ama mwanrokorihu mmoka noowolhiya ithalha ama hothalhelhiya. <verse eid="JAS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16" />Vanorera chani weerelha yayo, “Nlhuku ovaherekeni! Nrweeke wo mpuha mwootteke mooro, mwalhieke nnoowona, wo uhimmaha ittu iriyoothe yo unkavihera mwiiruttuni mwawe?” <verse eid="JAS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17" />Paahi etu upisha nrima vekha aya wo uhooniha mitheko yoyo uhokhwa.<verse eid="JAS 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18" />Nansho ntu nowooria wiira, “Inyu nhanaa nrima, ni mii kihanaa mitheko.” Eiyo nkooniheke etu nrima inyu uhiri ni ntheko uyo, ni mii kinowoonihani nrima wo mitheko chaka. <verse eid="JAS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19" />Inyu nnorumelhelha wiira Nlhuku ri mmoka tu. Aye! Nansho ata mashoka o unanara ni ayo anomwoova yoyo ni unthukumelha. <verse eid="JAS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20" />Nhopwapwa inyu! Chani mwoonihiyeke wiira nrima wo uhikhalha mitheko uhokhwa? <verse eid="JAS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21" />Apwiiya Aburahimu aalhakelhelhiye chani wiira ahovarechesha ikekhia mmiholho wa Nlhuku? Wo nlhatu wo mitheko chaya vankuminhe aya isadaka yo upahiya mwaamwanaya Isaka vamadhubahuni vo ukumiheriya isadaka. <verse eid="JAS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22" />Paahi etu mwooneke vavawo wiira upisha nrima waya wahoonia wo mitheko chaya ni vavawo nrima uyo wahokhomaalhihiya. <verse eid="JAS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23" />Paahi Malhove Matakatifu yahotimira venre aya, “Aburahimu ahonrumelhelha Nlhuku. Ni wo nrima waya ahoonia wiira ahopanga chittu chinothanana awe Nlhuku.” Nkayeehaniya ampwana awe Nlhuku. <verse eid="JAS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24" />Haya etu nchuwelheke wiira ntu naalhakelhiya wiira hovarechesha ikekhia mmiholho wa Nlhuku wo mitheko chawe kuhii wo upisha nrima vekha ayaru.<verse eid="JAS 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25" />Yaari thoko chiichammo wa Narahabu, nthiyana o ulhavalhava ulhe. Ahaalhakelhelhiya wiira ahovarechesha ikekhia mmiholho wa Nlhuku wo nlhatu wo mitheko chawe, vaapochenre awe akarumiya o uhotelha aakihaka wo waaviriha iphiro chikina.<verse eid="JAS 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26" />Paahi etu thoko vari aya iruttu ihimmumulha ihokhwa, phiri aya chiichammo nrima uhinooniha mitheko uhokhwa.<verse eid="JAS 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3" />
  <para style="s1">Nlhimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1" />Ashilhoko aka, nhihuvelhe ukhalha owiittuchiha enchi munlhokoni mwinyu. Nchuwelheke wiira hii owiittuchiha va ninowa uhukumulhiya wo uweria chinene waapwaha attu akina ayo. <verse eid="JAS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2" />Ukhalhawaya hii onkhaye va phi attu ninokwakwathuwa wo iphiro chinchi. Nansho ntu hinotteka wo nuulhumo nawe, yoyo horeeriya wo kila ittu, nowooria utawara iruttu awe yonkhaye. <verse eid="JAS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3" />Mwooneke, wiira ninowaattuka afarasi uwano ikipande yo yuuma ittukiye mikhoyi wiira aniiwelhelhe noorie urukunusha iruttu chaya ni waarweha uriwoothe unothanana ihu. <verse eid="JAS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4" />Tho, mwooneke ikalhava chineera aya. Inonnuwaka chani ni weeta chikakhiyaka ni iphioo yo machiri, chineetihiya wo nshukani mwankani unovarelha awe ntu neetiha uyo wookolha urweha unothanana awe. <verse eid="JAS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5" />Nlhimi ninno chiicho, itturi ikaani mwiiruttuni, nansho ninowiishipa wo upanga chittu chulhupalhe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 3:5">Mooro chiicho, mwooneke, unakhalha vakani, unowooria upaha ithuphi yuulhupalhe chinene! <verse eid="JAS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6" />Nlhimi ninno chiicho niri thoko mooro. Itturi ikani mwiilhaponi iri mwiiruttuni mwihu, ichanre milhatu cho uwonya, inoninanariha iruttu yonkhaye ni unipaha mooro ukumi ihu wonkhaye. Ukhalhawaya unoparihelhiya ni mooro unokhuma Ujehannamu unenene.<verse eid="JAS 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7" />Ntu nowooria waahuwa ashinama o kila nikosho. Nowooria waahuwa ashinama o umwiini, waahuwa ashinuni, waahuwa anaakoko ni waahuwa ashinama o mmashini. <verse eid="JAS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8" />Nansho khaawo ntu nooria uhuwa nlhimi, ukhalhawaya nlhimi niri no uwonya uhintawaria, nihochara uhapalha uneeva. <verse eid="JAS 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9" />Wo nlhimi ninontotopelha Nlhuku Athumwanihu. Ni wo nlhimi nenno ninowaalhava attu yuupiye wo ikhove ya Nlhuku. <verse eid="JAS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10" />Ashilhoko aka khavanorera mmalhakuni nkhume malhove o waatotopelha attu moombone ni malhove o waalhava attu. Ashilhoko aka uwaninyu mwaatti ihikhalhe chiicho. <verse eid="JAS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11" />Chani nrapo nimoka ninowooria uthekhuma maashi o uririya ni maashi o maakha? <verse eid="JAS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12" />Ashilhoko aka, chani mwembe unowooria wimma ikokho? Ama nzabibu unowooria uyara ittini? Khavanooria! Chiichammo etu nrapo no maashi o maakha khaninthekhuma maashi o uririya.<verse eid="JAS 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Irusho cho ukhuma wa Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13" />Chani mpani ri ni irusho ni o uchuwelha munlhokoni mwinyu? Paahi etu ooniheke chechiyo wo meetelho oombone ni wo mitheko chorera chinopangia wo wiitimarikha ni wo irusho. <verse eid="JAS 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14" />Nansho mwakhalhaka ni nrima uchanre ihache ni ichimwa ni wiichoona, nhilhikache ukhuneelha ikeekhene wo wiititihachera irusho chinyu. <verse eid="JAS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15" />Irusho thoko chechiyo khachinokhuma wiirimu nansho cha attu o mwiilhaponi momu, khachihii cho Iphumu ya Nlhuku, chinokhuma wa Nakare. <verse eid="JAS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16" />Ukhalhawaya varii ihache ni wiichoona, vavawo vahochara injarare ni kila mitheko cho uwonya. <verse eid="JAS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17" />Nansho irusho chinokhuma wiirimu, chiri chorera, tho chinottuna mpuha, tho cho wiitimarikha, tho cho ikiriri ni cho uwiiha mitheko choombone. Khachinanarilhe nrima mena khachiri cho nrima wo unafiki. <verse eid="JAS 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18" />Attu anaalha mu ikekhiani, anokhungura chittu cho mumpuhani.<verse eid="JAS 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4" />
  <para style="s1">Wiichaatameriha wa Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1" />Anaa indewo ni uhiiwananiya munlhokoni mwinyu mmo chinokhuma vayi? Chani khachimmwiihiya ni itama inoothemwihani mwiiruttuni mwinyu iyo? <verse eid="JAS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2" />Nnoothanana upatta ittu, nansho ukhalhawaya khannopatta, paahi etu nnowiiva ni woona ihache. Phi naatakana inyu indewo nansho khannopatta ittu inothanana inyu ukhalhawaya khannonlhepelha Nlhuku. <verse eid="JAS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3" />Vanonlhepelha inyu Nlhuku vawo khannopatta ukhalhawaya nnolhepelha wo nrima wo uhilhoka. Nnolhepelha wiira mmwonihiye itama chinyu. <verse eid="JAS 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4" />Inyu mwaati o ulhuva va! Khanchuwenlhe wiira uttuna chittu cho mwiilhaponi mu phi wiipanga amalhaponi a Nlhuku? Paahi etu ntu nottuna chittu cho mwiilhaponi yoyo heepanga mmalhaponi a Nlhuku. <verse eid="JAS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5" />Paahi etu nhaanyihere wiira Malhove Matakatifu anoolhumacha malhove o uhikhalha maana vaneera aya, “Nlhuku nowoona ihache chinene wo Iphumu yenshe awe mwiiruttuni mwihu.” <verse eid="JAS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6" />Nansho Nlhuku honivaha nnema mulhupalhe chinene, thoko chilhepiye aya wiira, “Nlhuku nowaavenga attu o mahuchuru, nansho nowaavaha nnema mulhupalhe attu o wiitimarikha.”<verse eid="JAS 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7" />Paahi etu mmwiiwelhelheke Nlhuku. Munvingeke Nakare ni uyo nowuttawani. <verse eid="JAS 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8" />Mmwaatamerieke Nlhuku ni uyo nowaatameriani. Mwiihapiheke mathatha inyu, mwaatti o uwonya va! Nkwecheke mirima chinyu, mwaatti o mirima miilhi va! <verse eid="JAS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9" />Nchukulheke, munlheke ni wiichunlhelha. Uthiaa winyu uthathuweke nunlhiho ni mpuha winyu uthathuweke ukhalha wiichunlhelha. <verse eid="JAS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10" />Nkhalheke wo wiitimarikha mmiholho wa Athithi, ni ayo anoutheeshani.<verse eid="JAS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Waamukiya mwaha wo waahukumulha akina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11" />Ashilhoko aka, nhootheriane mwaashineneru. Nomwootheria ama unhukumulha nhima awe, yoyo hootheria ni uhukumulha Ikekhia ya Nlhuku. Nansho mwahukumulhaka Malhehero, paahi inyuva vavawo khannovara ikekhia, nnowiira uhukumulha. <verse eid="JAS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12" />Nlhuku vekha awe phi neemesha Ikekhia ni uhukumulha. Vekha awe phi noopolha ni wiiva. Vano inyu phi apani nnaahukumulha akhunaninyuva?<verse eid="JAS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nhichaalhakelhe wo nlhatu no meelho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13" />Paahi nkiiwelhelheke vano, mwaatti nneera, “Lhelho ama meelho ninoorwaa ilha iwani ilha ama ikina, nirwee nakhalheke wowo iyaakha imoka, napange maronda ni upatta ifaida.” <verse eid="JAS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14" />Mwaatti khanchuwenlhe chinohalha aya ukhalha meelho! Ukhalhawaya mwaatti nri thoko ittapwe inoonia wo ikatema ikhuvi nansho kaanyuma inoowalhawalha. <verse eid="JAS 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15" />Mwaatti nnophavelhiya wiira, “Nlhuku Athithi attunaka, ninookhalha akumi ni upanga ilha ni ilha.” <verse eid="JAS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16" />Nansho mwaatti vano nnowiishipa ni wiichoona. Wowo wiititihacha wonkhaye uwo uri wo uhilhoka.<verse eid="JAS 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17" />Paahi etu, ntu chuwenlhe upanga morera nansho hipangaka, yoyo howonya.<verse eid="JAS 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5" />
  <para style="s1">Waamukiya attu o nhakhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1" />Vano etu, nkakiiweni mwaatti attu o nhakhuva! Munlheke ni wiichukulhelha wo nlhatu wo uhuva unowa uri mmiholho winyu. <verse eid="JAS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2" />Nhakhu inyu uhoonta ni ikuwo chinyu chihovariya ikutihi. <verse eid="JAS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3" />Idhahabu ni nchurukhu winyu chiholhiya nrenje. Ni nenno nrenje nno phi nohalha uhimiecheshani milhatu ni upaha iruttu chinyu thoko mooro. Nheeshungera nhakhu wo mahuku o umalhelha alha. <verse eid="JAS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4" />Nkeewani! Khamwalhivilhe anamitheko avanre mitheko mmamatani mwinyu. Nkeewelhelhani chineera aya wo wunlha chiyo! Ikutto chaya chihaaphiyelha Athithi o Ikuru! <verse eid="JAS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5" />Nhokhalha mwiilhaponi wo wiiphwacha ni wiiteelhiha chinene. Nhoneneviha mirima chinyu ni ukhalha thoko mwannama noweherera nihuku no uhithiya. <verse eid="JAS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6" />Nhonhukumulha ntu e ikekhiaye ni umwiiva ntu huwirinheni ittu.<verse eid="JAS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uvilhelha mu uhuvani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7" />Paahi etu ashilhoko aka, nvilhelheke mpaka nihuku no uhokolhia Athithi. Mmwooneke namalhima chinoweherera awe cholhia mmatani mwawe wiira chikhomaalhe, nooweherera avilhelhaka toka ntipashilhe mpaka umalha nlhaalha ipulha vanorupa aya velhaponi. <verse eid="JAS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8" />Ni inyu mwaatti nvilhelheke chiicho. Mweemelheke rata chinene munrimani, ukhalhawaya nihuku no uwa Athithi nihaatameria.<verse eid="JAS 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9" />Ashilhoko aka, nhitukutuwache mwaashineneru, nhiwe mwaahukumulhiya. Nchuwelheke wiira, mwaanyulha uyo ri vankhorani. <verse eid="JAS 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10" />Ashilhoko aka mwoopuwelheke anamilhohi oolhumacha nttenga ukhuma wa Athithi, mwooneke chera aya wo uvilhelha mu uhuvihiyani, ni inyu mwaatwariheke yayo etu. <verse eid="JAS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11" />Nineehana yayo attu o upuha ukhalhawaya ari o uvilhelha. Nheewa mwaatti uvilhelha wa Naayubu, nchuwelhaka chenre aya wo upangelhiya ni Athithi wo umalha waya. Ukhalhawaya Athithi phi o rera nrima ni o ikiriri.<verse eid="JAS 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12" />Upwaha chonkhaye chiyo, ashilhoko aka, nhilhupelhe vanolheha inyu ittu! Nhilhupelhe wo uromolha irimu mena ilhapo mena ittu ikina iriyoothe. Mwiireke Eiyo, mwathananaka wiira Eiyo. Mwiireke Kihiwe vanothanana inyu wiira Kihiwe. Nhiwe mwaahukumulhiya ni Nlhuku.<verse eid="JAS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ulhapelha wo nrima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13" />Yakhalhaka haawo ntu riyoothe nohuva munlhokoni mwinyu, anlhapelheke Nlhuku. Ama yakhalhaka hawo ntu o nrima wo nopuha, yoyo eepeke ichipo cho untotopelha Nlhuku. <verse eid="JAS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14" />Chani haawo nreta munlhokoni mwinyu? Yoyo ehaneke ashulhupalhe o nlhoko wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo, awe anlhapelhelha ni unhika makhura wo nchina na Athithi. <verse eid="JAS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15" />Ukhalhawaya ulhapelha wo nrima unonlhamiha nreta. Athithi anonhokolhoshera machiri tho nreta uyo, noolhama. Ni vavawo yakhalhaka howonya noohiyereriya uwonya wawe.<verse eid="JAS 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16" />Paahi etu nkhoromelhaneke uwonya winyu mwaashineneru, nlhapelhelhaneke wiira nlhamihiye. Ukhalhawaya ulhapelha wo ntu nopanga moombone thoko chinothanana awe Nlhuku uhanaa machiri o upanga chittu chinchi, alhapelhaka wo ukuruvalhelha. <verse eid="JAS 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17" />Naeliya yaari o makhalhelho anolhikaana thoko hii. Yayo aholhapelha wo ukuruvalhelha wiira ipulha ihirupe, ni iyo khayaarumpe velhaponi wo iyaakha ttaaru ni nusu. <verse eid="JAS 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18" />Yamalheke nkayaalhapelha tho, irimu nkayaattukuwa ipulha nkayaarupa, ilhapo nkayaamelha cholhia.<verse eid="JAS 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19" />Ashilhoko aka, ntu mmoka arukunuwaka ni uhiya ikeekhene ya Nlhuku ni ntu nkina anhokolhoshaka, <verse eid="JAS 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20" />nchuwelheke wiira, ntu nonhokolhosha ntu nkina wi ikeekhene ya Nlhuku, nowoopolha ukumi wa yoyo ntu uyo unookhwani ni uhiyereriya uwonya wawe winchi.<verse eid="JAS 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5" />
</usx>